  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#34] [Performance] ServiceConfiguration uses reflection on every property get/set — cache frequently accessed config values in CachedFeederConfiguration at construction time   New file: CachedFeederConfiguration.cs   - Caches IsEnabled, SerializerType, and ReceiveTimeout at construction time, avoiding per-access reflection through ServiceConfiguration.Get()   - Subscribes to INotifyPropertyChanged on the source so IsEnabled and ReceiveTimeout stay in sync if changed at runtime (e.g. hot-reload of feeder config)",
